[
  {
    "text": "Arby’s.",
    "startMs": 500,
    "endMs": 1610,
    "timestampMs": 500,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "R. B.",
    "startMs": 1710,
    "endMs": 3090,
    "timestampMs": 1710,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Roast beef.",
    "startMs": 3190,
    "endMs": 4500,
    "timestampMs": 3190,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "That sounds like a mystery solved.",
    "startMs": 4600,
    "endMs": 6840,
    "timestampMs": 4600,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Except those letters stand for something else.",
    "startMs": 6940,
    "endMs": 9720,
    "timestampMs": 6940,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And once you learn the stories behind these four restaurant names,",
    "startMs": 9820,
    "endMs": 13410,
    "timestampMs": 9820,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "you might never read their signs quite the same way again.",
    "startMs": 13540,
    "endMs": 17020,
    "timestampMs": 13540,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Picture a roast-beef sandwich beside two enormous letters.",
    "startMs": 17270,
    "endMs": 21090,
    "timestampMs": 17270,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "R and B.",
    "startMs": 21190,
    "endMs": 22490,
    "timestampMs": 21190,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Say them together.",
    "startMs": 22590,
    "endMs": 24020,
    "timestampMs": 22590,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "“Arby.”",
    "startMs": 24120,
    "endMs": 25200,
    "timestampMs": 24120,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "But according to Arby’s parent company, the name refers to the Raffel Brothers:",
    "startMs": 25450,
    "endMs": 30428,
    "timestampMs": 25450,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Leroy and Forrest.",
    "startMs": 30468,
    "endMs": 31990,
    "timestampMs": 30468,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "They founded the restaurant in Boardman, Ohio, in 1964.",
    "startMs": 32240,
    "endMs": 36860,
    "timestampMs": 32240,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Raffel Brothers.",
    "startMs": 37110,
    "endMs": 38620,
    "timestampMs": 37110,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "R. B.",
    "startMs": 38870,
    "endMs": 40250,
    "timestampMs": 38870,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Arby’s.",
    "startMs": 40500,
    "endMs": 41610,
    "timestampMs": 40500,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The initials belong to the founders.",
    "startMs": 41860,
    "endMs": 44200,
    "timestampMs": 41860,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The roast beef makes the coincidence especially easy to believe.",
    "startMs": 44440,
    "endMs": 48660,
    "timestampMs": 44440,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "That’s what makes this a good naming mystery.",
    "startMs": 48910,
    "endMs": 51600,
    "timestampMs": 48910,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The answer seems to be sitting right there on the menu.",
    "startMs": 51850,
    "endMs": 54960,
    "timestampMs": 51850,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "But the real explanation is standing behind the counter.",
    "startMs": 55210,
    "endMs": 58980,
    "timestampMs": 55210,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Two brothers whose initials became a name millions of customers would say when",
    "startMs": 59230,
    "endMs": 64286,
    "timestampMs": 59230,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "ordering lunch.",
    "startMs": 64326,
    "endMs": 65630,
    "timestampMs": 64326,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Now let’s move from two brothers to one daughter.",
    "startMs": 65880,
    "endMs": 68650,
    "timestampMs": 65880,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Who was Wendy?",
    "startMs": 69300,
    "endMs": 70600,
    "timestampMs": 69300,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "If your answer is “the founder’s daughter,” you’re on the right track.",
    "startMs": 71750,
    "endMs": 75530,
    "timestampMs": 71750,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "But there’s another detail.",
    "startMs": 75780,
    "endMs": 77540,
    "timestampMs": 75780,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Her name was Melinda.",
    "startMs": 77790,
    "endMs": 79540,
    "timestampMs": 77790,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Dave Thomas considered his children’s names before choosing Melinda’s nickname",
    "startMs": 79790,
    "endMs": 84254,
    "timestampMs": 79790,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "for the restaurant.",
    "startMs": 84294,
    "endMs": 85770,
    "timestampMs": 84294,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Wendy’s official history explains that her siblings had trouble pronouncing her name.",
    "startMs": 86020,
    "endMs": 91955,
    "timestampMs": 86020,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "“Wenda” eventually became “Wendy.”",
    "startMs": 91995,
    "endMs": 94470,
    "timestampMs": 91995,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A family nickname became a restaurant name.",
    "startMs": 94720,
    "endMs": 97660,
    "timestampMs": 94720,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Imagine that transformation.",
    "startMs": 97910,
    "endMs": 100060,
    "timestampMs": 97910,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "At home, it’s a name your brothers and sisters call you.",
    "startMs": 100310,
    "endMs": 103770,
    "timestampMs": 100310,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Outside, it becomes a sign above a restaurant.",
    "startMs": 104020,
    "endMs": 107140,
    "timestampMs": 104020,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Then customers start saying it without knowing anything about the",
    "startMs": 107390,
    "endMs": 111134,
    "timestampMs": 107390,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "family behind it.",
    "startMs": 111174,
    "endMs": 112510,
    "timestampMs": 111174,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The name sounds like a person because it came from one.",
    "startMs": 112760,
    "endMs": 116150,
    "timestampMs": 112760,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "But the story sits one layer beneath the obvious answer.",
    "startMs": 116400,
    "endMs": 120230,
    "timestampMs": 116400,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Wendy was real.",
    "startMs": 120480,
    "endMs": 121960,
    "timestampMs": 120480,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Wendy was also a nickname.",
    "startMs": 122210,
    "endMs": 124360,
    "timestampMs": 122210,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Now for a name with something you can actually picture.",
    "startMs": 124610,
    "endMs": 128170,
    "timestampMs": 124610,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "You hear “Taco Bell,” and the words seem perfectly matched to the logo.",
    "startMs": 128820,
    "endMs": 133230,
    "timestampMs": 128820,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A taco restaurant.",
    "startMs": 133480,
    "endMs": 135170,
    "timestampMs": 133480,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A bell.",
    "startMs": 135420,
    "endMs": 136440,
    "timestampMs": 135420,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "But the Bell is also a person.",
    "startMs": 137490,
    "endMs": 139740,
    "timestampMs": 137490,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Glen Bell founded the chain, opening its first restaurant in Downey,",
    "startMs": 139990,
    "endMs": 145400,
    "timestampMs": 139990,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "California, in 1962.",
    "startMs": 145440,
    "endMs": 147070,
    "timestampMs": 145440,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "His surname is right there in the brand.",
    "startMs": 147320,
    "endMs": 149710,
    "timestampMs": 147320,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Once you know that, the name reads differently.",
    "startMs": 149960,
    "endMs": 152800,
    "timestampMs": 149960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "It isn’t simply a food followed by a familiar object.",
    "startMs": 153050,
    "endMs": 156880,
    "timestampMs": 153050,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "It’s the food followed by the founder.",
    "startMs": 157130,
    "endMs": 159510,
    "timestampMs": 157130,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The bell symbol makes the name easy to visualize.",
    "startMs": 159760,
    "endMs": 163050,
    "timestampMs": 159760,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "But the family name gives it another meaning.",
    "startMs": 163300,
    "endMs": 166200,
    "timestampMs": 163300,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "We’ve now found brothers, a daughter’s nickname,",
    "startMs": 166450,
    "endMs": 169300,
    "timestampMs": 166450,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and a founder hiding in plain sight.",
    "startMs": 169340,
    "endMs": 171760,
    "timestampMs": 169340,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Our last stop takes us somewhere quite different.",
    "startMs": 172010,
    "endMs": 174790,
    "timestampMs": 172010,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A coffee shop name that leads to a novel.",
    "startMs": 175040,
    "endMs": 177950,
    "timestampMs": 175040,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Before we reveal this one, take a guess.",
    "startMs": 178600,
    "endMs": 181110,
    "timestampMs": 178600,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Was Starbucks named after a founder?",
    "startMs": 181360,
    "endMs": 183770,
    "timestampMs": 181360,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A type of coffee?",
    "startMs": 184020,
    "endMs": 185480,
    "timestampMs": 184020,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Or a character in a book?",
    "startMs": 185730,
    "endMs": 187440,
    "timestampMs": 185730,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The book holds the answer.",
    "startMs": 188690,
    "endMs": 190480,
    "timestampMs": 188690,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "According to Starbucks, the name was inspired by Starbuck—the first mate aboard",
    "startMs": 190730,
    "endMs": 195815,
    "timestampMs": 190730,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "the Pequod in Herman Melville’s Moby-Dick.",
    "startMs": 195855,
    "endMs": 198810,
    "timestampMs": 195855,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The name we associate with coffee has a literary and seafaring connection.",
    "startMs": 199060,
    "endMs": 203910,
    "timestampMs": 199060,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Picture it on screen.",
    "startMs": 204160,
    "endMs": 205800,
    "timestampMs": 204160,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A book opening.",
    "startMs": 206050,
    "endMs": 207410,
    "timestampMs": 206050,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "“Starbuck.”",
    "startMs": 207660,
    "endMs": 208840,
    "timestampMs": 207660,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Then the familiar coffee-shop name.",
    "startMs": 209090,
    "endMs": 211290,
    "timestampMs": 209090,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A surprising route to something we now read without a second thought.",
    "startMs": 211540,
    "endMs": 215860,
    "timestampMs": 211540,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Four familiar names.",
    "startMs": 216510,
    "endMs": 218140,
    "timestampMs": 216510,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Two brothers.",
    "startMs": 218390,
    "endMs": 219660,
    "timestampMs": 218390,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A family nickname.",
    "startMs": 219910,
    "endMs": 221460,
    "timestampMs": 219910,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A founder’s surname.",
    "startMs": 221710,
    "endMs": 223270,
    "timestampMs": 221710,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And a sailor from a classic novel.",
    "startMs": 223520,
    "endMs": 225890,
    "timestampMs": 223520,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "You don’t need to know any of those stories to order lunch.",
    "startMs": 226140,
    "endMs": 229210,
    "timestampMs": 226140,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "But knowing them changes what you notice.",
    "startMs": 229460,
    "endMs": 231960,
    "timestampMs": 229460,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Next time you pass one of those signs, you’ll see more than a restaurant name.",
    "startMs": 232210,
    "endMs": 236690,
    "timestampMs": 232210,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "You’ll see a little piece of how it began.",
    "startMs": 236940,
    "endMs": 239370,
    "timestampMs": 236940,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Which story surprised you most?",
    "startMs": 239620,
    "endMs": 241740,
    "timestampMs": 239620,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And what company name should we investigate next?",
    "startMs": 241990,
    "endMs": 245150,
    "timestampMs": 241990,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Now you know.",
    "startMs": 245800,
    "endMs": 247010,
    "timestampMs": 245800,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Ordinary has secrets.",
    "startMs": 247260,
    "endMs": 249110,
    "timestampMs": 247260,
    "confidence": null
  }
]
